rice","בחמישים":"by fifty","אחוז":"percent","העבודה":"the work","לשעה":"for an hour","הבירה":"the beer","קרה":"cold (feminine)","למה":"why","עזב":"left","לסגור":"to close","החנות":"the store / the shop","כולם":"everyone","חוץ":"except / outside","ממני":"from me","הסרט":"the movie / the film","ידי":"by (hands of)","חבר":"friend","הקו":"the line","השיחה":"the conversation / the call","מוגש":"is served","כל":"every / all","יום":"day","בשתיים":"at two","שהפרויקט":"that the project","יימשך":"will last / will continue","שנה":"year","אבל":"but","באו":"came","המצב":"the situation","בצורה":"in a way","ברורה":"clear (feminine)","התמונה":"the picture","מהקיר":"from the wall","פה":"here / mouth","אחד":"one","שזה":"that this / that it","רעיון":"idea","טוב":"good","האורחים":"the guests","הוגשו":"were served","אוכל":"food","מצוין":"excellent","לשולחן":"to the table","מחר":"tomorrow","שנסע":"that we will go"},"words":[{"he":"הוגש","en":"was served","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"hugash"},{"he":"הובן","en":"was understood","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"huvan"},{"he":"הורד","en":"was removed","alt":["was downloaded"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"hurad"},{"he":"הוזמן","en":"was ordered","alt":["was invited"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"huzman"},{"he":"הוסבר","en":"was explained","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"husbar"},{"he":"הוחלט","en":"was decided","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"hukhlat"},{"he":"הופסק","en":"was stopped","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"hufsak"},{"he":"מוגש","en":"is served","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"mugash"},{"he":"מוזמן","en":"invited","alt":["welcome"],"from":"skill","tr":"muzman"},{"he":"הוגשה","en":"was served (feminine)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"hugshah"},{"he":"הוזמנה","en":"was invited (feminine)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"huzmenah"},{"he":"הוסברה","en":"was explained (feminine)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"husbrah"},{"he":"הופסקה","en":"was stopped (feminine)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"hufsakah"},{"he":"הורדה","en":"was removed (feminine)","alt":["was downloaded (feminine)"],"from":"skill","tr":"hurdah"},{"he":"הוזמנו","en":"were invited","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"huzmenu"},{"he":"הוסברו","en":"were explained","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"husbru"},{"he":"הוגשו","en":"were served","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"hugshu"},{"he":"האוכל","en":"the food","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"ha'okhel"},{"he":"הנושא","en":"the topic","alt":["the subject"],"from":"phrase","tr":"hanose"},{"he":"הכל","en":"everything","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"hakol"}],"lexemes":["הוגש","הוגשה","הוגשו","מוגש","הובן","הורד","הורדה","הוזמן","הוזמנה","הוזמנו","מוזמן","הוסבר","הוסברה","הוסברו","הוחלט","הופסק","הופסקה"],"tips":"## Huf'al - Passive of Hif'il\n\nThe **Huf'al** (הופעל) is the passive counterpart of Hif'il. If Hif'il means \"to serve\" (הגיש), Huf'al means \"was served\" (הוגש).\n\n### Pattern recognition:\n- Prefix **הו-** in past tense: **הוּגַשׁ**\n- Prefix **מו-** in present tense: **מוּגָשׁ**\n\n### Present tense (participle):\n| | Masculine | Feminine |\n|--|-----------|----------|\n| Singular | מוּגָשׁ | מוּגֶשֶׁת |\n| Plural | מוּגָשִׁים | מוּגָשׁוֹת |\n\n### Past tense:\n| Person | Form |\n|--------|------|\n| הוא | הוּגַשׁ |\n| היא | הוּגְשָׁה |\n| הם/הן | הוּגְשׁוּ |\n\n### Common Huf'al verbs:\n| Hif'il (active) | Huf'al (passive) | Meaning |\n|-----------------|-----------------|----------|\n| הגיש (served) | הוגש (was served) | |\n| הבין (understood) | הובן (was understood) | |\n| הוריד (removed) | הורד (was removed) | |\n| הזמין (ordered) | הוזמן (was ordered) | |\n| הסביר (explained) | הוסבר (was explained) | |\n| החליט (decided) | הוחלט (was decided) | |\n| הפסיק (stopped) | הופסק (was stopped) | |"}